Interviewer

A user accidentally deleted a file.

Answer

I will first check if a backup exists.

If backups are available, I will restore the file.

If not, I will escalate according to the company's recovery procedure because recovery depends on the filesystem and backup solution.

We need to consider these questions:-

Which filesystem is being used (ext4, XFS, etc.)
Whether backups are available
Whether any snapshot technology is being used (such as LVM snapshots or storage snapshots)
Whether the deleted data has already been overwritten
